# Session 1: 1796, one player, the French, Tactical off.
# The whole turn cycle and every menu once (docs\won-source-study.md, section 3.2).
# The shipped NWS.CFG plays the Allies with Tactical on; the Utility menu changes both.
seed 1
pace 1

# The intro (ARCH2.EXE) waits for a key; then the start menu.
wait 4
shot intro
key space
wait 4
shot start-menu
key s
wait 2
shot start-year
key enter
wait 3
shot objective
key space
wait 1
shot main-menu

# Utility: swap to the French, Tactical off.
key u
wait 1
shot utility
key a
wait 1
shot french
key t
wait 1
shot tactical-off
key esc
wait 1

# Information: each of the six pages.
key i
wait 1
shot inform-menu
key enter
wait 1
shot french-armies
key space
key i down enter
wait 1
shot allied-armies
key space
key i down down enter
wait 1
shot cities
key space
key i down down down enter
wait 1
shot force-summary
key space
key i down down down down enter
# Intelligence shows each army for a second; a key would skip ahead.
wait 7
shot intelligence
key space
key i down down down down down enter
wait 1
shot battles
key space
wait 1

# Recruit 1,200 men at Bordeaux.
key r
wait 1
shot recruit
key enter
wait 1
shot recruited
key esc
wait 1

# Move Napoleon from Paris to Lyon.
key m p
wait 1
shot move-to
key enter
wait 3
shot moved

# Ships, then back.
key s
wait 1
shot ships
key esc
wait 1

# End the turn; the Allies move.
key e
wait 1
shot end-turn
key y
wait 30
shot allies-moved
key space
wait 5
shot invaded
key space
wait 5
shot events
key space
wait 5
shot may-1796

# Turn 2. Commands: fortify Paris, then look at each command's first screen.
key c f
wait 1
shot fortify
key enter
wait 3
shot fortified
key c j
wait 1
shot join
key esc
wait 1
key c s
wait 2
shot supply
key c d
wait 1
shot detach
key esc
wait 1
key c r
wait 1
shot relieve
key esc
wait 1
key c a
wait 1
shot drill
key esc
wait 2
shot drill-esc

# Utility submenus.
key u n
wait 1
shot noise
key esc
wait 1
key u d
wait 1
shot display
key esc
wait 1
key u b
wait 1
shot balance
key esc
wait 1
key u e
wait 1
shot end-cond
key esc
wait 1
key u r
wait 1
shot random-events
key esc
wait 1
key u v
wait 1
shot vary-start
key esc
wait 1
key u h
wait 1
shot history
key esc
wait 1
key u a
wait 1
shot aggress
key esc
wait 1
shot utility-done

# Files: save the game.
key f
wait 1
shot files
key s
wait 1
shot save-slots
key enter
wait 3
shot saved

# End turn 2.
key e y
wait 30
shot allies-moved2
key space
wait 5
shot events2a
key space
wait 5
shot events2b
key space
wait 5
shot events2c
